<title>NEW ZEALAND: Citibank cuts NZ floating, fixed lending rates.</title>
<headline>Citibank cuts NZ floating, fixed lending rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand unit of Citibank said on Friday it had cut its floating home lending rate to 8.95 percent from 9.4 percent.</p>
<p>Its fixed one year rate drops to 8.6 percent from 8.75 percent, while its two and three year rates fall to 8.8 percent from 8.95 percent.</p>
<p>The new floating rate is effective immediately on all new loans, and brings Citibank's variable rate closer in line to those of other banks.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
